{"name":"numbpad piloting v1.1 variable-based","enabled":true,"description":"Edit of Migi's Numpad Piloting v1.1. One keybind per key; mode lives in the 'movement' variable (0 ground, 1 ship) instead of enabling/disabling groups.","type":"group","id":1,"items":[{"type":"function","name":"onLoad","enabled":true,"id":101,"code":"display_notice(\"Numpad Piloting V1.1 (variable-based edit) loaded. Original package by IGN Migi: forums.starmourn.com/discussion/397/numbpad-piloting-v1-1-new-nexus/p1?new=1 . Press End to toggle between ground and ship controls.\", 255, 8)"},{"type":"trigger","name":"Ground Disable","enabled":true,"id":102,"matching":"exact","whole_words":true,"case_sensitive":true,"text":"The ship's thrusters fire into action and carefully detach from the <station> docking bridge.","actions":[{"action":"variable","varname":"movement","valtype":"value","value":"1","op":"set"},{"action":"notify","notice":"Now using Space Movement controls.","notice_fg":"#0024ff","notice_bg":"#000000"},{"action":"highlight","highlight":"line","highlight_backref":"1","highlight_fg":"#ffffff","highlight_bg":"#000000"}]},{"type":"trigger","name":"Ground Enable","enabled":true,"id":103,"matching":"substring","whole_words":true,"case_sensitive":true,"text":"A shudder passes over the ship as it lands, docked in with <dock>","actions":[{"action":"variable","varname":"movement","valtype":"value","value":"0","op":"set"},{"action":"notify","notice":"Now using Ground Movement controls.","notice_fg":"#0024ff","notice_bg":"#000000"},{"action":"highlight","highlight":"line","highlight_backref":"1","highlight_fg":"#ffffff","highlight_bg":"#000000"}]},{"type":"trigger","name":"Spacewalk Clause","enabled":true,"id":104,"matching":"exact","whole_words":true,"case_sensitive":true,"text":"You are now space walking and have a limited amount of life-support power. You can use the SPACEWALK command to see what your options are.","actions":[{"action":"variable","varname":"movement","valtype":"value",